[#4471](/kb/incidents/4471) is marked known: one issue, one fix queued. The desk's own table says
otherwise. Placed by tenant (where they are, and which booking form they run) instead of by subject
or by intake's browser guess, #4471 holds two causes. The fix queued for the parser closes one.

